  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "John Collison (born August 1990) is an Irish entrepreneur. He is the president of Stripe, which he co-founded in 2010 with his brother Patrick. Collison was the youngest self-made billionaire in 2016. As of 2026, according to Bloomberg Billionaires Index, his net worth is estimated at US$9.3 billion.",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
